          "prior_text": "description: \"Design coherent screen-based experiences and connect approved designs to real behavior. Use for product UI, UI SPECs, READMEs, docs, diagrams and visual media; intent-grounded product research, experience alignment, evidence planning, deep visual exploration, meaningful candidate comparison, art direction, expressive contrast, perceptual and temporal inspection, default-deny original UI construction with scoped W1-W3 authorization, mature-resource adoption, local trials, asset engineering, brand/type/2D/3D/media craft, content design, UX writing, multilingual typography, responsive/accessibility review, complete states, theme/language variants, performance and real integration. Expand named-product analogies into experience questions; combine textual, visual and behavioral evidence; calibrate research to impact, uncertainty and improvement potential. Leads from a goal or continuation through init, iterate, audit, finish and optional shape, preserving independent expression and verifying actual use.\"\n"
